---

<SiteLayout title="SkyFi :: A Reading List">
	<main class="skyfi-page">
		<!-- Intro section -->
		<section class="skyfi-intro">
			<p class="skyfi-description">
				SkyFi is a mostly science fiction focused (with a mix of philosophy, music, horror, surrealism, and post-modern literature) book club made up of a group of people mostly based in new york city who mostly operate in the field of architecture. The lists below are some of the books we have read together and spinoffs they have inspired me to explore.
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- Currently reading -->
		<section class="currently-reading">
			<h3>Currently Reading :: October 2020</h3>
			<p class="reading-item">
				<strong>Pseudo Fiction ::</strong>
				<a href="#">Staying with the Trouble: Making Kin in the Chthulucene</a> by Donna Haraway
			</p>
			<p class="reading-item">
				<strong>Watching ::</strong>
				<a href="#">Alien 3</a>
			</p>
		</section>

		<!-- 4-column book lists -->
		<section class="book-lists">
			<div class="book-columns">
				<div class="book-column">
					<h4>SKYFI :: BOOKS WE HAVE READ (chronological)</h4>
					<ul>
						{clubReads.map(book => <li>{book}</li>)}
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="book-column">
					<h4>FAVORITES</h4>
					<ul>
						{favorites.map(book => <li>{book}</li>)}
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="book-column">
					<h4>SCIFI :: BOOKS I HAVE READ (under construction)</h4>
					<ul>
						{scifiReads.map(book => <li>{book}</li>)}
					</ul>
					<h4 style="margin-top: 24px;">FICTION (under construction)</h4>
					<ul>
						{fictionReads.map(book => <li>{book}</li>)}
					</ul>
				</div>

				<div class="book-column">
					<h4>PHILOSOPHY :: BOOKS I HAVE READ (under construction)</h4>
					<ul>
						{philosophyReads.map(book => <li>{book}</li>)}
					</ul>
					<h4 style="margin-top: 24px;">BOOKS ON THE RADAR</h4>
					<ul>
						{onRadar.map(book => <li>{book}</li>)}
					</ul>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>
</SiteLayout>

<style is:global>
	.skyfi-page {
		max-width: 1200px;
		padding: 20px var(--content-padding) 60px;
	}

	.skyfi-intro {
		margin-bottom: 40px;
	}

	.skyfi-description {
		font-size: 13px;
		line-height: 1.7;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		text-align: center;
		max-width: 700px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	.currently-reading {
		margin-bottom: 40px;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.currently-reading h3 {
		font-size: 14px;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--accent);
		margin: 0 0 16px 0;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
	}

	.reading-item {
		font-size: 13px;
		color: var(--text);
		margin: 0 0 8px 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
	}

	.reading-item strong {
		color: var(--accent-dim);
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.reading-item a {
		color: var(--accent);
		text-decoration: underline;
	}

	.book-lists {
		margin-top: 40px;
		padding-top: 30px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
	}

	.book-columns {
		columns: 4;
		column-gap: 40px;
		column-rule: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
	}

	.book-column h4 {
		font-size: 11px;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-weight: 400;
		color: var(--accent);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		margin: 0 0 16px 0;
		break-after: avoid;
	}

	.book-column ul {
		list-style: none;
		padding: 0;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.book-column li {
		font-size: 12px;
		line-height: 1.6;
		color: var(--text-muted);
		margin: 0 0 4px 0;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		break-inside: avoid;
	}

	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.book-columns {
			columns: 2;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 600px) {
		.book-columns {
			columns: 1;
		}
	}
</style>
